  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "OnDegraded": "Continue",
  "Description": "The Animation Object Generation (PGM-AOG) AIM is a Sub-AIM of A-User Formation (PGM-AUF). It generates the animation of the Persona of the A-User: from an Action Object, an action of the Persona with no effect on the M-Instance, it produces a Face Animation Object (Port Number 1) or a Body Animation Object (Port Number 2), Animation Objects (PAF-AMO) whose Animation Qualifier names the content format of the animation, which it gives to Entity Face Description and Entity Body Description. It is driven by the AUC-AUF Request and reports with an AUC-AUF Response.",
